      "seed": 201651374,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1942409608,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790013511707,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Assumptions\n\n1. Delivery is at-least-once end to end, so every\ntransform is idempotent and keyed on event id.\n\n2. No synchronous service-to-service calls:\ncomponents meet only at the stream, the bus or the\nqueue, and each scales on its own backlog.\n\n3. All compute is serverless or auto-scaled. Nothing on\nthe critical path is a single instance.\n\n4. Every queue has a DLQ (5 receives), every job a Step\nFunctions catch, every write a retry with jitter.\n\n5. eu-west-1 across 3 AZs; RPO 15 min / RTO 1 h via\nS3 cross-region replication and Redshift snapshots to\nus-east-1.\n\n6. AWS Config, Secrets Manager and AWS Backup are\nenabled account-wide and left off the canvas.",
      "originalText": "Assumptions\n\n1. Delivery is at-least-once end to end, so every\ntransform is idempotent and keyed on event id.\n\n2. No synchronous service-to-service calls:\ncomponents meet only at the stream, the bus or the\nqueue, and each scales on its own backlog.\n\n3. All compute is serverless or auto-scaled. Nothing on\nthe critical path is a single instance.\n\n4. Every queue has a DLQ (5 receives), every job a Step\nFunctions catch, every write a retry with jitter.\n\n5. eu-west-1 across 3 AZs; RPO 15 min / RTO 1 h via\nS3 cross-region replication and Redshift snapshots to\nus-east-1.\n\n6. AWS Config, Secrets Manager and AWS Backup are\nenabled account-wide and left off the canvas.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "pMuebZ5WEYix1JBHMoZtB",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b79"
    },
